<title>ESTONIA: MARKET MAKERS FOR KAUBAMAJA ANNOUNCED.</title>
<headline>MARKET MAKERS FOR KAUBAMAJA ANNOUNCED.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tallinn stock exchange said on Tuesday the market makers for shares in Tallinna Kaubamaja are Hoiupank, Vaartpaberiparisnike, HF Kapital, Uhispank and Forekspank.</p>
<p>Shares in Tallinna Kaubamaja move to the main list of the bourse from today.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
